{"unit_id":"2031814001yuyue-tech__dsh-side-chat#card-zh","repo":"2031814001yuyue-tech/dsh-side-chat","commit":"ac7d5f4f2fe958ef7a2e79555f4ac3e9863ed118","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Side Chat 是面向 DSH Web 的并行侧边对话插件。它在会话标题栏加入入口，并通过侧边面板创建独立 Session 和 Agent，让侧对话与主对话使用独立历史，同时继承主会话的工作目录、模型选项和 agent preset 组合。用户可以从面板新建、发送消息、切换和关闭侧对话，也可以用 /side 命令创建；侧 agent 可总结内容，并把摘要作为折叠提示注入主会话。面板支持最小化、调宽和消息 Markdown 展示，每个主会话最多创建八条侧对话。需要 DSH Web 及其 agents、sessions 等服务；代码没有声明额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:76-136","src/host.js:219-323","src/host.js:391-409","src/client.js:420-498","src/client.js:663-670"]}
{"unit_id":"2031814001yuyue-tech__dsh-side-chat#card-en","repo":"2031814001yuyue-tech/dsh-side-chat","commit":"ac7d5f4f2fe958ef7a2e79555f4ac3e9863ed118","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Side Chat adds parallel chats to DSH Web. Users can create, message, switch, and close isolated sessions in a panel or with /side. Side agents inherit the main setup and can return a summary to the main chat. The panel supports resizing and minimizing, with up to eight side chats per session.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:76-136","src/host.js:219-323","src/host.js:391-409","src/client.js:420-498","src/client.js:663-670"]}
