{"unit_id":"2031814001yuyue-tech__dsh-side-chat#feature-1","repo":"2031814001yuyue-tech/dsh-side-chat","commit":"ac7d5f4f2fe958ef7a2e79555f4ac3e9863ed118","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Side Chat 的功能「并行侧对话」：创建独立的 Session 和 Agent，继承主会话的工作目录、模型选项和 agent preset 组合。可在侧边面板新建，或用 /side 命令创建并附带首条消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:76-136","src/host.js:391-409"]}
